 ## Appendix E: Format version changes
 
+### Version 4
+
+Manifest file format changes:
+
+* Data and delete manifests are written as Parquet files in v4 tables; v1 through v3 tables continue to use Avro manifests
+* Manifest readers and writers must support both Avro and Parquet manifests when the format is explicitly selected
+* For unpartitioned tables, the `partition` field is omitted from Parquet manifests because Parquet cannot store an empty struct; readers must treat the missing field as an unpartitioned partition tuple
+
 ### Version 3
 
 Default values are added to struct fields in v3.
